<title>USA: West Virginia plans $57 mln GO bond sale Dec 10.</title>
<headline>West Virginia plans $57 mln GO bond sale Dec 10.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>West Virginia said it plans to sell $50 million of tax-exempt general obligation (GO) bonds and $7 million of taxable GO bonds on Dec 10 at 1100 EST through competitive auction.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
